<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Hui Shung to tender for 54,000T US soy/corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Hui Shung to tender for 54,000T US soy/corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Hui Shung Group will tender on Tuesday for a combined shipment of 38,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans and 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The Hui Shung Group comprises Hui Shung Agriculture and Food Corp, Eagle Food Industry and Charoen Pokphand.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>			    U.S. Gulf   Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>   One    38,000 soy  Dec 5-20    Dec 21-Jan 4</p>
<p>	    16,000 corn</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
